sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant APP as Mobile App
  participant API as Auth API
  participant FB as Firebase Auth
  participant DB as User Store
  U->>APP: Login
  APP->>API: POST /api/auth/login
  API->>FB: Verify token
  FB-->>API: Token result
  API->>DB: Upsert user + session
  DB-->>API: Success
  API-->>APP: Session + profile
